FerrionOS change to the upstream bootloader (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit f3d9261b5fc81418c259c5059f46ee7087e86ed8 after the existing recipe patches.

Embed the recipe-patched RedoxFS, not the registry copy, mark the unlocked boot filesystem Access::ReadOnly before any transaction, assert is_read_only() on load_to_memory and verify::Manifest::load, and match its syscall error type.

